body":"Godot uses LLVM (on Linux) to build official releases, and these flags are not causing an issue, I agree removing `-fmodules` is not the answer nor is `-fmodules` the root cause. \n\nCan I ask what your use case is for building Apple binaries with LLVM, given you are compiling on macOS anyway?\n\n> [!NOTE]\n>\n> I should be clear that it is [_Apple_'s fork](https://github.com/swiftlang/llvm-project) of LLVM that we use\n>\n> Thanks for the clarification, @bruvzg ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953137587/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953608645","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107199#issuecomment-2953608645","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107199","id":2953608645,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wDH3F","user":{"login":"OzelotVanilla","id":59910575,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTEwNTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59910575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla","html_url":"https://github.com/OzelotVanilla","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T06:18:53Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T06:18:53Z","body":"> Can I ask what your use case is for building Apple binaries with LLVM, given you are compiling on macOS anyway?\n\nThe reason is not related to godot itself (so it looks a bit off-topic here).\n\nHowever for the [documentation page](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.html), no requirements for compiler (type or version) is written in the requirement, so for me I believe somehow that, the latest version of compiler is considered acceptable when compiling. At least works for Vulkan I installed from `brew`, it looks fine.\n\nMaybe it is also good to let scons to check the compiler's type and version the user are using ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953608645/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953673272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107199#issuecomment-2953673272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107199","id":2953673272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wDXo4","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T07:33:48Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T07:33:48Z","body":"> However for the [documentation page](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/development/compiling/compiling_for_macos.html), no requirements for compiler (type or version) is written in the requirement, so for me I believe somehow that, the latest version of compiler is considered acceptable when compiling.\n\nIt's listing Xcode as requirement, and compiler is part of it.\n\n> At least works for Vulkan I installed from brew, it looks fine.\n\nHomebrew libraries usually have a hardcoded path, so it will work on your system, but resulting export templates might be non-portable.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953673272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953676750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107199#issuecomment-2953676750","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107199","id":2953676750,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wDYfO","user":{"login":"OzelotVanilla","id":59910575,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTEwNTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59910575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla","html_url":"https://github.com/OzelotVanilla","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T07:37:11Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T07:37:11Z","body":"I got what you said. Can we say that the homebrew installed clang, or the hardcoded path, could be the root of this compilation error ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953676750/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953683816","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107199#issuecomment-2953683816","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107199","id":2953683816,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wDaNo","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-08T07:42:50Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T07:42:50Z","body":"Homebrew clang definitely is the core of issue, its unmodified upstream LLVM, and both Xcode and OSXCross use a modified Apple version.\n\nHardcoded paths are not related. It just something to consider when building something you intend to distribute, it might not work on other macs without Homebrew and specific Homebrew packages installed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953683816/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2953698144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107199#issuecomment-2953698144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107199","id":2953698144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wDdtg","user":{"login":"OzelotVanilla","id":59910575,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5OTEwNTc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59910575?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla","html_url":"https://github.com/OzelotVanilla","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OzelotVanilla/subscriptions","organizations_